      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just got full body recently and this has been my biggest gripe with the experience. Having to float really high in the air to move at full speed while lying down is really annoying and I wish there were a toggle for disabling the crouch margins.\n\nI really don't want to be that guy that floats above everyone in full body but you kinda have to if you don't want to move slowly.",
